flowchart TD
  Start((Admin workflow)) --> Auth{Clerk session and admin role?}
  Auth -- No --> Deny[Protected sign-in or 403]
  Auth -- Yes --> Manage[Manage products, inventory or banners]
  Manage --> Validate[Validate allowed fields and values]
  Validate --> Draft[Create or patch Sanity draft]
  Draft --> Publish{Publish draft?}
  Publish -- No --> DraftEnd[Keep or discard draft]
  Publish -- Yes --> Public[Replace published document; remove draft]
  Public --> Revalidate[Revalidate storefront paths]
  Auth -- Yes --> Status[Request allowed fulfillment status change]
  Status --> Check[Check paid order and valid transition]
  Check --> Transaction[Atomically update order and record notification]
  Transaction --> Email[Attempt SMTP status email]
  Email --> Outcome{Delivery outcome?}
  Outcome -- Sent --> Sent[Record sent]
  Outcome -- Failed --> Retry[Record failed; admin can retry]
  Outcome -- Unknown --> Review[Record unknown; require review]
